    - ATTACHMENT CONTEXT: Briefly note the caregiver's attachment observations for psychosocial context.

    Adhere to Australian pediatric standards (RCH Melbourne/Queensland Health). Maintain high clinical utility for medical staff while remaining readable for parents.
  `;

  const response = await ai.models.generateContent({
    model,
    contents: prompt,
