    YOUR MANDATORY TASKS IN THE ASSESSMENT (A) SECTION:
    1. IMMUNISATION ALERT: Check the vaccinations list. If there are 'pending' vaccinations where the current date is past the 'dueDate', explicitly flag these as "MISSED/OVERDUE IMMUNISATIONS".
