✅ IMPLEMENTATION PLAN (1 → 4)

Red-flag escalation rules (engine + UI hooks)

Clinician handover summary UI

PDF export of handover

Offline-first safety checks

Each step builds on the last.

1️⃣ Red-Flag Escalation Rules (Core Safety Engine)

This is the single most important safety feature.

A. Create a Red-Flag Engine (Pure Logic)

src/clinical/redFlags.ts

export type RedFlagSeverity = "urgent" | "moderate";

export type RedFlag = {
  id: string;
  message: string;
  severity: RedFlagSeverity;
};

export function evaluateRedFlags(input: {
  ageMonths?: number;
  temperature?: number;
  symptoms: string[];
  durationDays?: number;
}): RedFlag[] {
  const flags: RedFlag[] = [];

  if (input.ageMonths !== undefined && input.ageMonths < 3 && input.temperature && input.temperature >= 38) {
    flags.push({
      id: "neonate-fever",
      message: "Fever ≥38°C in infant under 3 months",
      severity: "urgent"
    });
  }

  if (input.symptoms.includes("difficulty breathing")) {
    flags.push({
      id: "resp-distress",
      message: "Signs of respiratory distress",
      severity: "urgent"
    });
  }

  if (input.durationDays && input.durationDays > 5) {
    flags.push({
      id: "prolonged-illness",
      message: "Symptoms persisting longer than expected",
      severity: "moderate"
    });
  }

  return flags;
}


🔒 Why this matters

Pure function = testable

Centralised logic = auditable

Reusable across SymptomChecker, AcuteTracker, ScreeningTool

B. Surface Red Flags in UI (Non-Dismissable)
Example: SymptomChecker
const flags = evaluateRedFlags({
  ageMonths,
  temperature,
  symptoms,
  durationDays
});

{flags.map(flag => (
  <div
    key={flag.id}
    className={`p-4 rounded-xl ${
      flag.severity === "urgent"
        ? "bg-red-100 border-red-600"
        : "bg-yellow-100 border-yellow-600"
    } border-2`}
  >
    <strong>{flag.severity === "urgent" ? "Seek urgent medical care" : "Medical review recommended"}</strong>
    <p>{flag.message}</p>
  </div>
))}


⚠️ Do not allow users to dismiss urgent flags
This is intentional medico-legal protection.

2️⃣ Clinician Handover Summary (UI + Generator)

This is your flagship clinician feature.

A. Generator (Pure, Testable)

src/clinical/handover.ts

import { MedicalHistory, ChildProfile } from "../types";

export function generateHandover(
  profile: ChildProfile | undefined,
  history: MedicalHistory,
  latestWeight?: number
) {
  return {
    demographics: {
      name: profile?.name ?? "Unknown",
      dob: profile?.dob,
      age: profile?.age,
      weight: latestWeight
    },
    conditions: history.conditions,
    allergies: history.allergies,
    medications: history.currentMedications,
    recentEvents: history.acuteLogs.slice(0, 5),
    growth: history.growthRecords.slice(-3),
    appointments: history.appointments.filter(a => a.status === "Upcoming"),
    specialists: history.specialists
  };
}

B. UI Component (Clinician-Only)

HandoverSummary.tsx

