*** EMERGENCY: CALL 000 / AMBULANCE IF ***
${p.ambulanceTriggers || 'Not specified'}

DANGER SIGNS:
${p.dangerSigns || 'Not specified'}

CARER ACTIONS:
${p.carerActions || 'Not specified'}

